body=intro('YOUR JOURNEY, YOUR WAY','Let’s give your ideas<br>a place to <em>begin.</em>','Choose your dates, share your interests and bring the first details of your Morocco journey together.')+f'''<section class="container planner-layout collection"><aside><p class="eyebrow">A FEW DETAILS GO A LONG WAY</p><h2>Start with what you know.</h2><p>No fixed route yet? That’s fine. Your arrival city and the time you have are a useful starting point.</p><ol class="planner-steps"><li>Choose your travel window.</li><li>Tell us who is coming.</li><li>Add the places you would love to see.</li></ol><p class="notice">This planner creates a trip brief you can copy or download. Nothing is sent automatically, and this is not a booking.</p></aside><div><form id="trip-form" class="trip-form" data-email="{esc(site['email'],quote=True)}" data-whatsapp="{esc(site['whatsapp'],quote=True)}" hidden><div class="form-grid"><label>Your name <span>(optional)</span><input name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="100"></label><label>Travel month <span>(optional)</span><input type="month" name="month"></label><label>Arrival city<select name="arrival"><option>Not sure yet</option><option>Marrakech</option><option>Casablanca</option><option>Fes</option><option>Tangier</option><option>Agadir</option></select></label><label>Number of travellers<input name="travellers" type="number" min="1" max="100" value="2" required></label><label>Days in Morocco<input name="days" type="number" min="1" max="90" value="7" required></label><label>Accommodation preference<select name="comfort"><option>Help me choose</option><option>Comfortable riads and hotels</option><option>Premium stays</option><option>A mix of styles</option></select></label></div><label>Tour or destination <span>(optional)</span><input name="interest" maxlength="200" placeholder="A route, a place, or a little of both"></label><label>What would make this trip yours? <span>(optional)</span><textarea name="notes" maxlength="2000" rows="5" placeholder="Desert sunsets, local food, a slower pace…"></textarea></label><p class="form-note">Your details stay in this browser until you choose to copy, download or share them. Please leave out passport and payment information. {a('privacy.html','Privacy details')}.</p><button class="button" type="submit">Create my trip brief ↗</button></form><noscript><div class="planning-note"><h2>Plan your brief</h2><p>Write down your arrival city, travel month, number of travellers, trip length and the places you want to see. Enable JavaScript to use the interactive planner.</p></div></noscript><section id="trip-result" class="trip-result" hidden aria-labelledby="brief-title"><p class="eyebrow">READY FOR YOUR NEXT STEP</p><h2 id="brief-title" tabindex="-1">Your Morocco trip brief</h2><p>Review your brief below. It has not been sent.</p><pre id="brief-text"></pre><div class="button-row"><button class="button" id="copy-brief" type="button">Copy brief</button><button class="button secondary" id="download-brief" type="button">Download .txt</button><a class="button" id="share-brief" hidden>Share your enquiry ↗</a></div><p id="brief-status" role="status"></p><button class="text-button" id="edit-brief" type="button">← Edit my details</button></section></div></section>'''
